WEBVTT
NOTE SYNC_TYPE: HUMAN_VERIFIED
NOTE Track: 1-05 - Brother's Keeper
NOTE Artist: The Stardust Engine
NOTE Album: Our Own Frequency (2008)

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:16.467
[Instrumental Intro — Delicate Melancholy Piano & Comforting Acoustic Guitar]

00:00:16.467 --> 00:00:21.288
They look at the chair and they think it's weak

00:00:23.688 --> 00:00:30.000
They whisper their pity whenever we speak

00:00:30.690 --> 00:00:36.800
But they don't see the mornings, the stretches and pain

00:00:36.800 --> 00:00:42.832
The quiet routines keeping us sane

00:00:44.617 --> 00:00:51.500
Sleeping on the edge, a human bed rail

00:00:51.500 --> 00:00:57.384
Catching the other whenever we fail

00:01:00.025 --> 00:01:04.868
Moving the pieces the body forgot

00:01:07.430 --> 00:01:11.892
Holding the line whenever we're caught

00:01:14.571 --> 00:01:19.235
Being the strength when the daily tasks break

00:01:20.836 --> 00:01:27.862
Giving up comfort for the other one's sake

00:01:27.942 --> 00:01:33.667
A brother and a sister, fighting to survive

00:01:35.688 --> 00:01:41.500
The only reason we're staying alive

00:01:41.500 --> 00:01:48.500
Are we each other's keeper? We'll take the blame

00:01:48.500 --> 00:01:55.500
Standing in the fire, walking through the flame

00:01:55.500 --> 00:02:02.500
Answering the call when it gets too deep

00:02:02.500 --> 00:02:10.000
Guarding all the secrets we're trying to keep

00:02:10.000 --> 00:02:16.800
We trade all the armor, we trade all the scars

00:02:16.800 --> 00:02:23.500
We built our own world underneath all the stars

00:02:23.500 --> 00:02:30.000
When the body won't work, we become our own feet

00:02:30.000 --> 00:02:37.500
When the pressure is heavy, we make it retreat

00:02:37.500 --> 00:02:45.000
They don't understand the blood in our veins

00:02:45.000 --> 00:02:53.172
We're holding the keys and we're breaking the chains

00:02:53.172 --> 00:03:07.298
[Instrumental Interlude — Emotional Piano & Acoustic Guitar]

00:03:07.298 --> 00:03:14.000
Pushing the wheels wherever we go

00:03:14.000 --> 00:03:21.500
Being the shelter when bitter winds blow

00:03:21.500 --> 00:03:28.500
We trade all the armor, we trade all the scars

00:03:28.500 --> 00:03:35.000
We built our own world underneath all the stars

00:03:35.000 --> 00:03:41.500
When the body won't work, we become our own feet

00:03:41.500 --> 00:03:49.000
When the pressure is heavy, we make it retreat

00:03:49.000 --> 00:03:56.500
They don't understand the blood in our veins

00:03:56.500 --> 00:04:04.535
We're holding the keys and we're breaking the chains

00:04:06.517 --> 00:04:10.000
We keep each other safe.

00:04:14.304 --> 00:04:18.000
We keep each other grounded.

00:04:18.000 --> 00:04:29.500
[Outro — Resonating Piano Chord Fade]
